# Astro-Menu marketing site — build-time environment.
# Copy to .env for local dev; set the same names in the Vercel project.

# Web3Forms access key for the /contact and /ar/contact forms.
# Free at https://web3forms.com. Until this is set, both pages hide the form
# and lead with email instead of quietly dropping enquiries.
#
# PUBLIC_ is deliberate: a Web3Forms access key lives in the form markup where
# any visitor can read it, and can only submit to the inbox it belongs to.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
